flowchart TB
  S1["S1: Open and document the requisition"]
  S2{"S2: Approve headcount and budget"}
  S3["S3: Finalize the job description and selection criteria"]
  S4["S4: Source candidates"]
  S5["S5: Screen applications"]
  S6["S6: Recruiter phone screen"]
  S7["S7: Administer job-related assessments"]
  S8["S8: Conduct structured interviews"]
  S9{"S9: Debrief and make the selection decision"}
  S10["S10: Complete reference checks"]
  S11["S11: Approve compensation and extend a conditional verbal offer"]
  S12{"S12: Candidate response and negotiation"}
  S13["S13: Disclose, authorize, and run the background check"]
  S14{"S14: Adjudicate the results"}
  S15{"S15: Run FCRA adverse action (only if withdrawing)"}
  S16["S16: Extend the formal written offer"]
  S17["S17: Countersign and execute the agreement"]
  S18["S18: Initiate right-to-work and hand off to onboarding"]
  S1 --> S2
  S2 -->|Headcount and budget approved| S3
  S2 -->|Not approved — revise or defer| S1
  S3 --> S4
  S4 --> S5
  S5 --> S6
  S6 --> S7
  S7 --> S8
  S8 --> S9
  S9 -->|A suitable candidate is selected| S10
  S9 -->|No suitable candidate — re-open sourcing| S4
  S10 --> S11
  S11 --> S12
  S12 -->|Offer accepted| S13
  S12 -->|Counter-offer — re-approve and re-issue| S11
  S12 -->|Declined — revisit the shortlist| S9
  S13 --> S14
  S14 -->|Clears — no disqualifying, job-related information| S16
  S14 -->|Potentially disqualifying information found| S15
  S15 -->|Dispute resolved in the candidate's favor or record corrected| S16
  S15 -->|Adverse action upheld — offer rescinded, revisit the shortlist| S9
  S16 --> S17
  S17 --> S18
